From ed2cce67f706f639f7b348cf4e833d94aaecbfce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:29:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 53/69] LOCAL: arm64: configs: nairo: SCHEDSTATS for Rust,
 fixed release name

- CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=y: with it off, struct sched_statistics is empty but
  cacheline aligned. bindgen drops the alignment of the empty struct, so
  every task_struct field after "stats" is 40 bytes off in the Rust
  bindings; rust_binder then compared the wrong field against the VMA's
  mm and failed every mmap with -EINVAL.
- CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-nairo" without LOCALVERSION_AUTO: a release name
  that survives commits, so module trees and DKMS builds keep matching.
  Build with LOCALVERSION= set to avoid the "+" suffix.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config b/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
index 2037d8174..08d6b48c6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
@@ -69,3 +69,10 @@ CONFIG_ZRAM_DEF_COMP_ZSTD=y
 # Waydroid binder: this tree only has the Rust binder (includes binderfs)
 CONFIG_RUST=y
 CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_IPC_RUST=y
+# Stable release name across commits (modules, DKMS); build with LOCALVERSION= set
+CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-nairo"
+# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
+# Rust: with SCHEDSTATS off, struct sched_statistics is empty but cacheline
+# aligned; bindgen drops that alignment and every task_struct field after
+# "stats" is 40 bytes off in the Rust bindings (rust_binder mmap -EINVAL)
+CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=y
